The Wolfpack is a documentary film directed by Crystal Moselle.

2
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:13,500
Locked away from society in an apartment on the Lower East Side of Manhattan, the Angulo
brothers learn about the outside world through the films that they watch.

3
00:16:41,250 --> 00:16:47,250
Nicknamed ‘The Wolfpack’, the brothers spend their childhood reenacting their
favorite films using elaborate home-made props and costumes.

4
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Their world is shaken up when one of the brothers
escapes and everything changes.

