01:01:11,250 --> 01:01:17,250
The Wolfpack is a 2015 American documentary film directed by Crystal Moselle.

12
01:06:45,000 --> 01:06:51,000
It is about the Angulo family, who homeschooled and raised their seven children (six boys and one girl) in
the confinement of their apartment on the Lower East Side of Manhattan in New York City.

13
01:12:18,750 --> 01:12:24,750
The film premiered on January 25, 2015, at the Sundance
Film Festival, where it won the U.S.

14
01:17:52,500 --> 01:17:58,500
Documentary Grand Jury Prize.

15
01:23:26,250 --> 01:23:32,250
The film explores themes of sibling relationship, parent child
relationship, manhattan, new york city, woman director, confinement.
